{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystic Tesserae is a new take on the Falling Sand genre, with 2.5d graphics and complete new interactions. You play by using Elements and building worlds with them to discover, learn and observe different behaviors. Great for Players that like pixel simulation and for Artist that want a different take on Pixel Art.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 Elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300x300x78 Canvas Size.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 7 Million Pixels Simulated at all times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Tools to Help Drawing / Creating on the Canvas.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of Elements to discover the interactions between them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and build according to your imagination.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corner of The Screen\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Allows you to Play while doing other things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680320/extras/new_image_for_description.png?t=1749467604\" /></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling Sand</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling sand simulation where all pixels are simulated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your creativity to build beautiful and unique designs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680320/extras/Mystic_casa_gif_15_seconds.gif?t=1749467604\" /></p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"htt